  "2026-10-22T12:50:24.654Z",codex-agent,"Whole-PR evidence review against origin/main 46295a6: sync and closeout callers retain audited SHA 67a5e3e1514fddeeae29951da00513f06f7aa0ab and package version 2026.10.16; both files are byte-identical to main. Linked a two-caller assertion command. Original delivery ancestry remains verified. This certifies retained caller configuration, not a new external workflow dispatch. Closed state and timestamps are unchanged."
